---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Lumma Creative Studio" description="Learn about Lumma Creative Studio, its educational direction, and the relationship between Lumma and Aya.">
  <section class="page-hero about-hero">
    <div class="container about-hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow" data-lumma-en="About Lumma" data-lumma-id="Tentang Lumma">About Lumma</span>
        <h1 class="display" data-lumma-en="The studio behind Lumma and the Aya learning universe." data-lumma-id="Studio di balik Lumma dan dunia pembelajaran Aya.">The studio behind Lumma and the Aya learning universe.</h1>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="lead" data-lumma-en="Lumma Creative Studio develops educational ideas into practical forms: content channels, learning platforms, books, resources, and digital experiences. We work across these formats because families do not learn in only one place." data-lumma-id="Lumma Creative Studio mengembangkan gagasan pendidikan menjadi berbagai bentuk praktis: kanal konten, platform belajar, buku, sumber belajar, dan pengalaman digital. Kami bekerja di berbagai format karena keluarga tidak belajar hanya di satu tempat.">Lumma Creative Studio develops educational ideas into practical forms: content channels, learning platforms, books, resources, and digital experiences. We work across these formats because families do not learn in only one place.</p>
        <p data-lumma-en="Our current work is centred on meaningful learning for Muslim families, with Aya providing a familiar creative world that connects several of these experiences." data-lumma-id="Pekerjaan kami saat ini berpusat pada pembelajaran yang bermakna bagi keluarga Muslim, dengan Aya sebagai dunia kreatif yang menghubungkan beberapa pengalaman tersebut.">Our current work is centred on meaningful learning for Muslim families, with Aya providing a familiar creative world that connects several of these experiences.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="container about-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow" data-lumma-en="What Lumma does" data-lumma-id="Apa yang Lumma lakukan">What Lumma does</span>
        <h2 class="title" data-lumma-en="One educational direction, expressed through different kinds of work." data-lumma-id="Satu arah pendidikan yang diwujudkan melalui berbagai bentuk karya.">One educational direction, expressed through different kinds of work.</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="lead" data-lumma-en="A project may begin as a story and later become a book, an activity, a language lesson, a family resource, or a digital tool. We therefore think about the educational purpose before deciding on the format." data-lumma-id="Sebuah proyek dapat dimulai sebagai cerita lalu berkembang menjadi buku, kegiatan, pelajaran bahasa, sumber belajar keluarga, atau alat digital. Karena itu, kami mempertimbangkan tujuan pendidikan terlebih dahulu sebelum menentukan bentuknya.">A project may begin as a story and later become a book, an activity, a language lesson, a family resource, or a digital tool. We therefore think about the educational purpose before deciding on the format.</p>
        <p data-lumma-en="We care about clarity, usefulness, cultural and religious sensitivity, strong storytelling, and interfaces that are straightforward for families to use." data-lumma-id="Kami memperhatikan kejelasan, manfaat, kepekaan budaya dan agama, penceritaan yang kuat, serta antarmuka yang sederhana untuk digunakan keluarga.">We care about clarity, usefulness, cultural and religious sensitivity, strong storytelling, and interfaces that are straightforward for families to use.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow" data-lumma-en="Lumma & Aya" data-lumma-id="Lumma & Aya">Lumma & Aya</span>
      <h2 class="title" data-lumma-en="Two related roles, clearly defined." data-lumma-id="Dua peran yang saling terkait, dengan fungsi yang jelas.">Two related roles, clearly defined.</h2>
      <div class="about-relationship-grid">
        <article class="about-role-card">
          <span class="role-index">01</span>
          <h3>Lumma Creative Studio</h3>
          <p data-lumma-en="The organisation and creative studio responsible for developing educational content, products, platforms, and digital experiences." data-lumma-id="Organisasi dan studio kreatif yang mengembangkan konten pendidikan, produk, platform, dan pengalaman digital.">The organisation and creative studio responsible for developing educational content, products, platforms, and digital experiences.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="about-role-card about-role-accent">
          <span class="role-index">02</span>
          <h3>Aya</h3>
          <p data-lumma-en="The central character and educational universe through which related stories, learning experiences, platforms, and products can connect." data-lumma-id="Karakter utama dan dunia pendidikan yang menghubungkan berbagai cerita, pengalaman belajar, platform, dan produk.">The central character and educational universe through which related stories, learning experiences, platforms, and products can connect.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="container about-values-grid">
      <div><span class="eyebrow" data-lumma-en="How we work" data-lumma-id="Cara kami bekerja">How we work</span><h2 class="title" data-lumma-en="Useful first. Thoughtful throughout." data-lumma-id="Utamakan manfaat. Tetap berpikir secara mendalam.">Useful first. Thoughtful throughout.</h2></div>
      <div class="about-values-list">
        <div><strong data-lumma-en="Purposeful learning" data-lumma-id="Pembelajaran yang memiliki tujuan">Purposeful learning</strong><p data-lumma-en="Each experience should have a clear educational reason to exist." data-lumma-id="Setiap pengalaman belajar harus memiliki alasan pendidikan yang jelas.">Each experience should have a clear educational reason to exist.</p></div>
        <div><strong data-lumma-en="Family context" data-lumma-id="Konteks keluarga">Family context</strong><p data-lumma-en="Learning is stronger when it can connect with conversations, routines, and shared use." data-lumma-id="Pembelajaran menjadi lebih kuat ketika terhubung dengan percakapan, rutinitas, dan kegiatan bersama.">Learning is stronger when it can connect with conversations, routines, and shared use.</p></div>
        <div><strong data-lumma-en="Age-appropriate design" data-lumma-id="Desain sesuai usia">Age-appropriate design</strong><p data-lumma-en="Language, presentation, pacing, and interaction should respect the learner's stage." data-lumma-id="Bahasa, penyajian, tempo, dan interaksi harus sesuai dengan tahap perkembangan pembelajar.">Language, presentation, pacing, and interaction should respect the learner's stage.</p></div>
        <div><strong data-lumma-en="Responsible technology" data-lumma-id="Teknologi yang bertanggung jawab">Responsible technology</strong><p data-lumma-en="Digital tools should serve the learning experience rather than become the experience itself." data-lumma-id="Teknologi digital harus mendukung pengalaman belajar, bukan menjadi tujuan itu sendiri.">Digital tools should serve the learning experience rather than become the experience itself.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
